#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:7
#: b3cf8a08c99a4a028115aa6ef81554ce
msgid ""
"Copter/Plane/Rover support integration with GPS, Compass and other non-GPS "
"positioning technologies. Sub supports only Compass, so some device below "
"can only utilize the Compass portion of the hardware:"
msgstr ""
"Copter/Plane/Rover 支持与 GPS、罗盘及其他非 GPS 定位技术的集成。Sub "
"仅支持罗盘，因此以下某些设备只能使用其硬件的罗盘部分："

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:15
#: c9aa1a265d6142e2842acb585704bc1c
