msgstr "GPS/罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:51
#: 3b58abc5e58c4dee841665dfdeda9aaa
msgid "RTK GPS"
msgstr "RTK GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:53
#: 831643a0edec481fa355c98a0177cb5e
msgid ""
"These GPS can incorporate real time kinematic data, either internally "
"generated or externally provided, to improve the precision of the position "
"estimate from the normal GPS meter range down to the centimeter range (see "
":ref:`common-rtk-correction`). This increased precision also allows for "
"\"Moving Baseline\" yaw estimates using two devices on a vehicle with "
"certain RTK GPSes (F9P based) or dedicated Moving Baseline GPSes. See "
":ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`."
msgstr ""
"这些 GPS 可以整合实时动态数据（内部生成或外部提供），将位置估计精度从正常 GPS 的米级提高到厘米级（参见 :ref:`common-rtk-"
"correction`）。这种更高的精度还允许在使用某些 RTK GPS（基于 F9P）或专用动态基线 GPS "
"时，通过在飞行器上安装两个设备实现「动态基线」偏航估计。参见 :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:98
#: 6e0787eddc144facabdf602e8261f6c5
msgid ""
"a version of firmware for the CubePilot HERE 4 DroneCAN RTK GPS is available"
" `here <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/Here4AP/>`__ that "
"includes evolving ArduPilot improvements."
msgstr ""
"CubePilot HERE 4 DroneCAN RTK GPS 的一个固件版本可在 `此处 "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/AP_Periph/latest/Here4AP/>`__ 获取，其中包含不断改进的 "
"ArduPilot 增强功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:100
#: 4230ad2def8d4b038d6a61e4dea2dc5a
msgid ""
"It is important that a GPS be connected to the first SERIALx port that has "
"its ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` parameter set to \"5\" (GPS) since it will stop "
"searching for GPS during bootup if not found on the first port configured "
"for GPS protocol."
msgstr ""
"重要的是，GPS 必须连接到第一个将 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` 参数设置为「5」（GPS）的 SERIALx "
"端口，因为如果在第一个配置了 GPS 协议的端口上未找到 GPS，系统将在启动时停止搜索 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:104
#: 0d09d3560d904576945ee247d124fc55
msgid "Moving Baseline (GPS for Yaw) Capable"
msgstr "支持动态基线（GPS 用于偏航）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:130
#: 9e37172e5530461290ef98b0ac26a720
msgid "GPS Driver Options"
msgstr "GPS 驱动选项"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:132
#: e9f0ff586e6940aebca6ba2328dca1be
msgid ""
"Several GPS operating options are provided by the "
":ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` parameter. This parameter is a bit "
"mask and allows multiple option selections at the same time:"
msgstr ""
":ref:`GPS_DRV_OPTIONS<GPS_DRV_OPTIONS>` 参数提供了多种 GPS "
"运行选项。该参数是一个位掩码，允许同时选择多个选项："

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:134
#: 1e7a7b51d7ae44ba989db2a145bdf606
msgid ""
"bit 0: if set, will send RTK correction data from the first GPS directly to "
"the second via the second's UART port for :ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`, instead"
" via the autopilot."
msgstr ""
"第 0 位：如果设置，将把第一个 GPS 的 RTK 校正数据直接通过第二个 GPS 的 UART 接口发送给第二个 GPS（用于 "
":ref:`common-gps-for-yaw`），而不是通过飞控转发。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:135
#: 58972807449c422893a8839d47de7eb7
msgid ""
"bit 1: if set, enable SBF moving baseline yaw using custom base and GPS_MB1 "
"offsets."
msgstr "第 1 位：如果设置，使用自定义基站和 GPS_MB1 偏移量启用 SBF 动态基线偏航。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:136
#: e48704469e3c498dbff4f6ac1b8da902
msgid ""
"bit 2: if set, use 115.2Kbaud for max serial data rate for those GPSes not "
"capable of higher rates."
msgstr "第 2 位：如果设置，对于不支持更高波特率的 GPS，使用 115.2Kbaud 作为最大串口数据速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:137
#: 36308ba89a2a41a9b630f03ba8fce03d
msgid ""
"bit 3: if set, routes RTK data between two CAN GPSes via CAN instead of via "
"the autopilot."
msgstr "第 3 位：如果设置，通过 CAN 而非飞控在两个 CAN GPS 之间路由 RTK 数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:138
#: ec9d8ab3aa0e46109fd829e37daa9fdc
msgid ""
"bit 4: if set, GPS reports altitude in ellipsoid height instead of height "
"AMSL."
msgstr "第 4 位：如果设置，GPS 以椭球高度而非海拔高度（AMSL）报告高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:141
#: ec8a0d6d38af4061b30874eaa8e286f2
msgid "GPS Auto Switch"
msgstr "GPS 自动切换"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:143
#: 6aef8ee8a596407096154e72a0c6f11b
msgid ""
"When using two GPS units there are a number of switching options that can be"
" selected with :ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>`."
msgstr "使用两个 GPS 时，可以通过 :ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` 选择多种切换选项。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:146
#: 4745c021a85b46b2882da078218cbd92
msgid "0: Use Primary"
msgstr "0：使用主 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:146
#: 21707cee00bb4a65b4c4b542c6a817c0
msgid ""
"Always use the primary GPS, this can be either the first or second as set "
"with :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY <GPS_PRIMARY>`"
msgstr "始终使用主 GPS，可通过 :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY <GPS_PRIMARY>` 设置为第一个或第二个 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:149
#: 123893d110564898b871778f72235e53
msgid "1: Use best"
msgstr "1：使用最佳"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:149
#: 9dbaded36f6b43b692d68ba4785c7847
msgid ""
"Automatically select the best GPS, this is done based on GPS fix status (2D "
"/ 3D / rtk) if both GPSs have the same fix status the one with the larger "
"number of satellites is used."
msgstr "自动选择最佳 GPS，基于 GPS 定位状态（2D/3D/RTK）进行判断；如果两个 GPS 定位状态相同，则使用卫星数量更多的那个。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:152
#: 0c90e6ba817b4b57b2d6a62b8493ebde
msgid "2: Blend"
msgstr "2：混合"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:152
#: 2f3d38a16f53496fac3d9e6a09df23ec
msgid ""
"Blend is best suited for use with two identical GPS units, see :ref:`GPS "
"blending<common-gps-blending>`"
msgstr "混合模式最适合两个相同型号的 GPS 单元，参见 :ref:`GPS 混合使用<common-gps-blending>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:157
#: b7032829cde54b1c823dc8e6aa270cb9
msgid "4: Use primary if 3D fix or better"
msgstr "4：如果 3D 定位或更好则使用主 GPS"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:155
#: cbc1734fc99b4070a827db71c250730e
msgid ""
"Use primary GPS as set with :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY <GPS_PRIMARY>` if it has a 3D "
"fix or better. This should be used when two dissimilar GPS units are used, "
"one high quality primary unit, and a secondary less accurate unit. In this "
"case the high quality GPS will often have a better quality fix even if it "
"has fewer satellites. Using 'Use best' in this case would result in using "
"the poorer quality GPS and result in more switching between GPS units. "
"Unlike 'Use Primary' this option still allows falling back to the secondary "
"GPS if 3D fix is lost on the primary."
msgstr ""
"如果通过 :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY <GPS_PRIMARY>` 设置的主 GPS 具有 3D 定位或更好的状态，则使用该主 "
"GPS。当使用两个不同型号的 GPS（一个高质量主 GPS，一个精度较低的副 GPS）时，应使用此模式。在这种情况下，高质量 GPS "
"通常具有更好的定位质量，即使卫星数量较少。使用「使用最佳」在此情况下会导致使用质量较差的 GPS，并造成更多的 GPS 切换。与「使用主 "
"GPS」不同，此选项在主 GPS 失去 3D 定位时仍允许切换到副 GPS。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:159
#: 30b2245e4cbd442fa1e962c9614edcca
msgid ""
"An additional variation with GPS switching is :ref:`EKF3 affinity and lane "
"switching <common-ek3-affinity-lane-switching>`. An EKF lane can be setup to"
" use either GPS and the whole EKF lane is then switched based on its health."
" If the :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY <GPS_PRIMARY>` is used for a lane, and "
":ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` is enabled, then the lane will use "
"GPS info as determined by the :ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` "
"setting."
msgstr ""
"GPS 切换的另一个附加变体是 :ref:`EKF3 亲和性和通道切换 <common-ek3-affinity-lane-"
"switching>`。可以设置 EKF 通道使用任一 GPS，然后根据其健康状态切换整个 EKF 通道。如果 :ref:`GPS_PRIMARY "
"<GPS_PRIMARY>` 用于某个通道，并且启用了 :ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>`，则该通道将根据"
" :ref:`GPS_AUTO_SWITCH <GPS_AUTO_SWITCH>` 设置使用 GPS 信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:162
#: 8b72b67f2d554eccab13c2d772062308
msgid "GPS Jamming Mediation"
msgstr "GPS 干扰应对"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:164
#: a5ea4fd6c05045d2b5dfd86e8f976183
msgid ""
"Setting the \"JammingExpected\", :ref:`EK3_OPTIONS<EK3_OPTIONS>` bit 0, will"
" change the EKF3 behaviour such that if dead reckoning navigation is "
"possible it will require the preflight alignment GPS quality checks "
"controlled by :ref:`EK3_GPS_CHECK<EK3_GPS_CHECK>` and "
":ref:`EK3_CHECK_SCALE<EK3_CHECK_SCALE>` to pass again before resuming GPS "
"use if GPS lock is lost for more than 2 seconds (presumably due to jamming)."
" This is to prevent bad GPS data from being used, since the GPS data will be"
" immediately used upon re-lock otherwise and could be corrupt."
msgstr ""
"设置「JammingExpected」（:ref:`EK3_OPTIONS<EK3_OPTIONS>` 第 0 位）将改变 EKF3 "
"的行为：如果死算导航可行，它将要求由 :ref:`EK3_GPS_CHECK<EK3_GPS_CHECK>` 和 "
":ref:`EK3_CHECK_SCALE<EK3_CHECK_SCALE>` 控制的飞前对准 GPS 质量检查再次通过，然后才能恢复 GPS "
"使用（如果 GPS 定位丢失超过 2 秒，可能是由于干扰）。这是为了防止使用错误的 GPS 数据，因为否则 GPS "
"数据在重新定位时会立即被使用，可能是错误数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-positioning-landing-page.rst:167
#: 3db4c4259faa4306b062a5776a52cf26
msgid "Advanced Uses"
msgstr "高级用法"
